(7090674, 1080056, 30982, '<td valign="top">I can''t say who this reminds me of (and it does remind me of someone) but I do very much like it!  Quite lovely.  Bright, ethereal, a bit bittersweet, but warmly so.</td>', 'I can''t say who this reminds me of (and it does remind me of someone) but I do very much like it!  Quite lovely.  Bright, ethereal, a bit bittersweet, but warmly so.', '2013-08-21 02:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
