(7092027, 1080164, 103142, '<td valign="top">hahaha! I love it!! If the bird was on a deck railing, I would have sworn this was my back yard -- I have that same branch in my bokeh, too! Love the pose. :)</td>', 'hahaha! I love it!! If the bird was on a deck railing, I would have sworn this was my back yard -- I have that same branch in my bokeh, too! Love the pose. :)', '2013-08-24 11:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7092030, 1079846, 114285, '<td valign="top">Well I feel chuffed that you chose me to imitate ;)<br/> <br/>Lovely shallow DOF which I tend to try to always achieve, the vertical crop is not really my style, but with this type of flower it does really complement it. The tip of the flower is just a bit too close to the frame for my comfort, but overall a good sharp image. 7</td>', 'Well I feel chuffed that you chose me to imitate ;) Lovely shallow DOF which I tend to try to always achieve, the vertical crop is not really my style, but with this type of flower it does really complement it. The tip of the flower is just a bit too close to the frame for my comfort, but overall a good sharp image. 7', '2013-08-24 11:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7092032, 1080094, 114285, '<td valign="top">I''m kicking myself I didn''t emulate ursula one of my fave photographers on here.<br/> <br/>Lovely abstract overall, great colors and blur, I prefer the bottom half to the top, 7.</td>', 'I''m kicking myself I didn''t emulate ursula one of my fave photographers on here. Lovely abstract overall, great colors and blur, I prefer the bottom half to the top, 7.', '2013-08-24 11:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
