(7092203, 1080163, 83313, '<td valign="top">I haven''t done any rusty cars for a while, but it is indeed one of my stereotypical subjects. This has a much softer look than what I think I would probably do with. The duotone is a nice take on the theme. <br/> <br/>I knew I had done an entry with this title, but had to go back to some of my earlier DPC entries to find it. That was when I was far less subtle with the tonemapping. It had done decently but not great for me.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=624780" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/783/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_624780.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/783/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_624780.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/783/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_624780.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Your image actually had me thinking of this one, which had a different title:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=904831" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1256/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_904831.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1256/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_904831.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1256/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_904831.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I''ve suggested in the score thread that we should do a "debriefing" thread after this challenge and submit our original shots to the member we were trying to emulate for them to edit. I''d love to have a crack at this and see what I might do with it myself.</td>', 'I haven''t done any rusty cars for a while, but it is indeed one of my stereotypical subjects. This has a much softer look than what I think I would probably do with. The duotone is a nice take on the theme.  I knew I had done an entry with this title, but had to go back to some of my earlier DPC entries to find it. That was when I was far less subtle with the tonemapping. It had done decently but not great for me.  Your image actually had me thinking of this one, which had a different title:  I''ve suggested in the score thread that we should do a "debriefing" thread after this challenge and submit our original shots to the member we were trying to emulate for them to edit. I''d love to have a crack at this and see what I might do with it myself.', '2013-08-24 21:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
