(7092579, 1080199, 63218, '<td valign="top">Thank you for associating my name with this lovely image. I''m flattered to pieces because although I have tried many times to achieve an image like this, I''ve never been able to do it. The center of my attempts is never as interesting as I hope for. As interesting as this one. Of course I love the motion blur, the contrast, the combination of soft &amp; sharp, &amp; the color...so, thank you, thank you very much.</td>', 'Thank you for associating my name with this lovely image. I''m flattered to pieces because although I have tried many times to achieve an image like this, I''ve never been able to do it. The center of my attempts is never as interesting as I hope for. As interesting as this one. Of course I love the motion blur, the contrast, the combination of soft & sharp, & the color...so, thank you, thank you very much.', '2013-08-25 20:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
