(7093987, 1079697, 158518, '<td valign="top">wow! 4th place! :D<br/> <br/>I''m very happy for this placement (first time in top 5) and for having done a good tribute to Alessandro ;)<br/> <br/>I was shooting at dawn, when I''ve seen this friend of mine at the border of my viewfinder... then I rotated the camera and thought "let''s try"<br/> <br/>this was a really lucky shot: the light, the mist, my friend that stayed quite immobile for all the 5 seconds (during the shot I prayed "don''t move, don''t move, don''t move..." :D )<br/> <br/>thanks to all who voted and commented! :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-08-28 11:45:03.</i></td>', 'wow! 4th place! :D I''m very happy for this placement (first time in top 5) and for having done a good tribute to Alessandro ;) I was shooting at dawn, when I''ve seen this friend of mine at the border of my viewfinder... then I rotated the camera and thought "let''s try" this was a really lucky shot: the light, the mist, my friend that stayed quite immobile for all the 5 seconds (during the shot I prayed "don''t move, don''t move, don''t move..." :D ) thanks to all who voted and commented! :)', '2013-08-28 06:00:36.000000', '2013-08-28 12:45:03.000000', 0),
(7093991, 1080174, 6519, '<td valign="top">I am sad. I would have sworn you''d do something different, something that isn''t 100% your signature style.<br/> <br/>Stunning photo, but very disappointing.</td>', 'I am sad. I would have sworn you''d do something different, something that isn''t 100% your signature style. Stunning photo, but very disappointing.', '2013-08-28 06:25:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7094009, 1080204, 140537, '<td valign="top">Thanks so much for the positive comments.<br/>I must admit that I had an advantage, having no style of my own and basically just trying to improve through visual plagiarism.<br/>My second best score and best finish so far. I think I am on to something.<br/> <br/>For the next challenge, I guess I should have copied Gyaban.</td>', 'Thanks so much for the positive comments.I must admit that I had an advantage, having no style of my own and basically just trying to improve through visual plagiarism.My second best score and best finish so far. I think I am on to something. For the next challenge, I guess I should have copied Gyaban.', '2013-08-28 07:04:06.000000', NULL, 0),
