(7094082, 1080174, 87808, '<td valign="top">As soon as I saw it, I knew it was yours. lol, the reason people think it is yours is because you have feather shots in your port about 11 times and about 4 times they have water drops on them and bubeltrubel only has a feather in about 3 shots in her port.  SO that is the confusion I think! Still a most stunning image!</td>', 'As soon as I saw it, I knew it was yours. lol, the reason people think it is yours is because you have feather shots in your port about 11 times and about 4 times they have water drops on them and bubeltrubel only has a feather in about 3 shots in her port.  SO that is the confusion I think! Still a most stunning image!', '2013-08-28 10:06:39.000000', NULL, 0),
